How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:\\
{{:media:netgear:r7500_serial.jpg?direct&400|}}

NOTE That the R7500v1 has two serial headers:
  * J1 (depicted on the picture above) is the "main" serial interface
  * J3 is the serial interface for the Quantenna chip

Pinout is the same for both headers:
  * Pin 1 (marked with white dot on circuit board) = +3.3 V (do not connect anything to this pin)
  * Pin 2 = TX
  * Pin 3 = RX
  * Pin 4 = GND


